      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志小姐、东海帝王小姐。\n两位都是近年来成长显著的话题人物。\n对两位而言，“想追寻的背影”是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "254b9c811fd59b558844390561aa6c4d8ac132f23e9c39158f589f11621a7152",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
